OL,3,GNEWSAKing to visit city for first time
OL,4,Aas monarch
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III has announced he will
OL,7,Fvisit Preston for the first time as
OL,8,Fmonarch.
OL,10,FThe royal visit will take place on
OL,11,FMonday, when the head of state will be
OL,12,Fjoined by local charities, community
OL,13,Fgroups and faith leaders to celebrate
OL,14,Fthe city.
OL,16,FLord-Lieutenant of Lancashire Amanda
OL,17,FParker JP will welcome the King at a
OL,18,Freception at The Harris Museum, Art
OL,19,FGallery and Library. People will then
OL,20,Fbe able to see the King in person at a
OL,21,Fmeet and greet at the Flag Market.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
