OL,3,GNEWSAKing to visit city for first time
OL,4,Aas monarch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe monarch, who is also Duke of
OL,7,FLancaster, is due to highlight the
OL,8,Fpeople and organisations that
OL,9,Fcontribute to Preston as a "diverse,
OL,10,Fthriving heritage and community".
